5.3 TIMING BREAKDOWN (from sample 2D log: AEROD_v, 1 thread)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Step                        CUDA (ms)   OpenMP (ms)
Find critical points        8.59        —
Sort critical points        5.38        —
Kernel compression          18.04       79.98
Kernel decompression        40.14       42.16
Post-processing (restore)   295.87      —
Total compression           33.36       79.98
Total decompression         320.45      —

NOTE: CUDA decompression is dominated by post-processing (topology restoration).
      The kernel-only decompression (40ms) is comparable to OpenMP (42ms).
      Post-processing adds 296ms due to host-device transfers per colour-class pass.
      Fusing kernels to eliminate transfers is listed as future work.


